    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The earliest Mill Creek entities were mining companies founded in 1863, showing the area’s roots in California’s gold rush era.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://paulfloreswriter.wordpress.com/2026/02/16/mill-creek-through-the-ages-a-165-year-study-of-californias-most-prolific-creek-named-entities/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 1921 nonprofit, The Cedars on Mill Creek, Inc., and a 1924 mutual service company have survived more than a century, illustrating the town’s long‑standing community focus.",
